			Medium calliber gun, designed for Anti-Tank role.
			Uses gimbal mount for free rotation!
			</Description>
			<Icon>Textures\GUI\Icons\Cubes\57mm_Gumbal_Turret.dds</Icon>
			<CubeSize>Small</CubeSize>
			<BlockTopology>TriangleMesh</BlockTopology>
